  "goodToKnow": "Der Verwalter (die Verwalterin) is an administrator or manager: der Hausverwalter (property manager, a key contact for tenants and owners), der Insolvenzverwalter, der Nachlassverwalter (estate administrator). Verwalten means to manage or administer, and die Verwaltung is administration, famous in Germany for its paperwork. Germans joke about verwalten instead of gestalten (administering instead of shaping). Plural: die Verwalter."
